  "notes": "Real 2-storey house, close view. Cream/off-white render (#e8e2d0) with a sandstone ashlar-block band on the lower-right bay (#c8ad7d). WOODEN front door (#b07a3f) with a small glazed panel, intercom and letter-slot, reached over a low white picket gate; a blue-glass window at left behind a hedge. A brown timber pergola/eave slat overhangs the right corner. Flat roof. Frontage: low light stone-block boundary walls, planter box, lemon shrub, palm and shade tree, silver saloon on the stone-slab drive. Colours sampled from ref 2026-07-04."
